  adaptive avg-pool → sinusoidal 2D PE + self-attention + LN → mean-pool → [B,D]) and
  BackboneProbeModule (Lightning module: backbone → ProbeHead → PoseSlotDecoder).
  Supports val_ap_every_n_epochs cadence (default=10), gt_sanity_check, per-step diagnostics.
- src/training/training_config.py: added BackboneProbeConfig with .build(backbone, data).
