  compute_probe_diagnostics.
- conf/backbone/cnn.yaml: new Hydra config group for backbone selection.
- conf/training_module/backbone_probe.yaml: new training_module config for BackboneProbeConfig.
- conf/benchmark_backbone.yaml: replaced pose_estimator group with backbone group; now
  uses backbone: cnn + training_module: backbone_probe.
- scripts/benchmark_backbone.py: rewritten to use BaseFeatureExtractorConfig + BackboneProbeConfig.
  Logs separate param counts (backbone / probe_head / decoder).
- tests/test_backbone_probe.py: 15 new tests covering ProbeHead shapes, gradients,
